{"total_count":631,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/256","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/256/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/256/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/256/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/256","id":1755777386,"node_id":"I_kwDOC3vcos5opwlq","number":256,"title":"Hide names? ","user":{"login":"Vitaaliyy","id":127446177,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5isoQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127446177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy","html_url":"https://github.com/Vitaaliyy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vitaaliyy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":14,"created_at":"2023-06-13T23:12:19Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T12:50:00Z","closed_at":"2023-06-14T08:34:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Mod loader\n\nForge\n\n### Minecraft version\n\n1.18.2\n\n### Mod version\n\n5.2.6\n\n### Modloader version\n\n40.2.0\n\n### Modpack info\n\n_No response_\n\n### If bug:\n\n- [ ] Can you reproduce this issue with relevant mods only?\n\n### If bug: The latest.log file\n\n_No response_\n\n### Issue description\n\nHello, I don't know where to ask this, so I'm doing it here, sorry if it's not the right place! \r\n\r\nIs there any way to hide player names in Jade? We have lore on the server, so we would like to have different characters but it's annoying if we can see the name of the player on top, thank you. ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/256/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/369","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/369/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/369/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/369/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/369","id":2116598726,"node_id":"I_kwDOC3vcos5-KLvG","number":369,"title":"Inventory blacklist not working in `jade_plugins.json`","user":{"login":"Artemis-Hound","id":10010491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDEwNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10010491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound","html_url":"https://github.com/Artemis-Hound","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artemis-Hound/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2024-02-03T17:14:32Z","updated_at":"2024-02-04T17:25:47Z","closed_at":"2024-02-04T00:40:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#### Edit: Correction in title: `jade_plugins.json` → `jade_addons.toml`\r\n\r\n### Mod loader\r\n\r\nFabric\r\n\r\n### Minecraft version\r\n\r\n1.18.2\r\n\r\n### Mod version\r\n\r\nJade-1.18.2-forge-5.3.1.jar\r\n\r\n### Modloader version\r\n\r\nForge 40.2.4\r\n\r\n### Modpack info\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### If bug:\r\n\r\n- [X] Can you reproduce this issue with relevant mods only?\r\n\r\n### If bug: The latest.log file\r\n\r\nhttps://pastebin.com/XKZin7Zn\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nThe blacklist section of ~~`jade_plugins.json`~~ `jade_addons.toml` does not appear to work for excluding certain inventories. \r\n\r\nI was trying to remove a modded inventory block from showing its contents in Jade, and noticed that adding the ID to the blacklist didn't seem to do anything in Jade. I tested it using a vanilla block (in this case the minecraft chest), and it still doesn't do anything. \r\n\r\nI also changed the `normalShowAmount` to test that the config was being loaded correctly, and it was (can see in the screenshots, the show amount was limited to 5).\r\n\r\n<details><summary><h3><s><code>jade_plugins.json</code></s> <code>jade_addons.toml</code> configuration</h3> <i>[click to show]</i></summary>\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n\r\n[inventory]\r\n\t#Range: 0 ~ 54\r\n\tsneakShowAmount = 54\r\n\t#Range: 0 ~ 54\r\n\tnormalShowAmount = 5\r\n\t#Range: 1 ~ 18\r\n\tshowItemPreLine = 9\r\n\tblacklist = [\"minecraft:chest\"]\r\n\tbypassLockedContainer = false\r\n\r\n[customContainerName]\r\n\tonlyShowVanilla = false\r\n\tblacklist = [\"thermal\"]\r\n\r\n```\r\n</details> \r\n\r\n### Screenshots:\r\n![2024-02-03_16-50-37_notepad++_NJ6](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/assets/10010491/c17dd91f-6f5d-46b3-8787-972a60b2f139)\r\n![2024-02-03_16-50-47_javaw_VSX](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/assets/10010491/d193f3dc-01b1-418f-9e46-70b423f67268)\r\n\r\nAm I configuring the TOML file wrong somehow, or does blacklist not work the way I thought it would? Or is it just a bug in this version? I have the latest version of Jade for 18.2 .","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/369/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/639","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/639/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/639/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/639/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/639","id":3246634307,"node_id":"I_kwDOC3vcos7Bg7VD","number":639,"title":"Causing lag with FallingTree mod","user":{"login":"ImpulsiveLass","id":92990441,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYrr6Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92990441?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass","html_url":"https://github.com/ImpulsiveLass","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpulsiveLass/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-07-20T19:53:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T11:24:05Z","closed_at":"2025-07-21T05:19:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"To display the progress of breaking a block on the Jade GUI, this mod gets the hardness of the block/finds how long with the given tool to break the block, just by looking at the block.\n\nA number of mods that allow you to instantly break a large number of wood or ores have a setting to at least partially consider the added time to break the block based on the original block.\n\nI.E. it may add 0.5 of the time to break for extra blocks, so if a tree is 10 logs tall it will be 1 + 9(0.5) times longer to break.\n\nJade calls for this to be calculated when targeting the given block with the correct tool.\n\nThis is not an issue for small little trees and veins but if there is a larger tree, lets say 100 logs, Jade will make the game shit itself as it keeps calculating/recalculating how much to progress the bar, especially if another tree sprouts up and the logs are touching, or another player or entity is adding more blocks for whatever reason.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/689","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/689/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/689/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Snownee/Jade/issues/689/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/689","id":3728213712,"node_id":"I_kwDOC3vcos7eOAbQ","number":689,"title":"[1.21.1] destroySpeed is redundant and causes issues with blocks with -1 destroySpeed but player sensitive destroyProgress like AllTheModium","user":{"login":"pietro-lopes","id":97140255,"node_id":"U_kgDOBco-Hw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97140255?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes","html_url":"https://github.com/pietro-lopes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietro-lopes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user